Package: com.xsxs18.xixu
Name: Xixu
Version: 1.1.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A fast, clean root file manager.
 Browse the whole file system as root, edit text, property lists and
 binaries, inspect Mach-O files and entitlements, open SQLite databases,
 extract and create archives, install packages and restore deleted items
 from the Trash. Rootless and roothide, iOS 15 to 26.
Maintainer: xsxs18
Author: xsxs18
Section: Applications
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: uikittools
